\.aikit\\codebase_map.md","hunks":[{"oldStart":7,"oldLines":10,"newStart":7,"newLines":10,"lines":[" \r"," ## 📊 Codebase Metrics\r"," - **Total Python Modules**: `67`\r","-- **Total Classes**: `174`\r","+- **Total Classes**: `175`\r"," - **Total Top-Level Functions**: `211`\r","-- **Total Class Methods**: `981`\r","-- **Total Source Lines**: `27788`\r","+- **Total Class Methods**: `985`\r","+- **Total Source Lines**: `27815`\r"," \r"," ---\r"," \r"]},{"oldStart":179,"oldLines":7,"newStart":179,"newLines":7,"lines":[" ### [`tests/test_cockpit_layout.py`](tests/test_cockpit_layout.py)\r"," > *Layout regression tests for the holographic web cockpit (index.html / style.css / app.js).*\r"," \r","-**Size**: `847` lines (`38270` bytes)\r","+**Size**: `874` lines (`39628` bytes)\r"," \r"," **Classes:**\r"," - `class _DomNode` - *Minimal element tree node built from html.parser events.*\r"]},{"oldStart":305,"oldLines":6,"newStart":305,"newLines":11,"lines":["   - Method `.setUpClass()`\r","   - Method `.test_map_views_share_one_visible_area_centre()`\r","   - Method `.test_territory_is_cached_and_drawn_from_politics()`\r","+- `class TestCelestialModels` - *Procedural celestial models: their own module, loaded before the cockpit, sprites cached.*\r","+  - Method `.setUpClass()`\r","+  - Method `.test_renderer_loads_before_the_cockpit()`\r","+  - Method `.test_every_generated_body_type_has_a_model()`\r","+  - Method `.test_surface_sprites_are_cached()`\r"," \r"," ---\r"," \r"]}]},{"filePath":"C:\\Users\\Yunus-Emre\\Desktop\\portable_agent_kit\\projects\\voidfarer\\.aikit\\task_ledger.json","hunks":[{"oldStart":5,"oldLines":29,"newStart":5,"newLines":12,"lines":["     \"last_phase\": \"phase 4\",\r","     \"active_phase\": 4,\r","     \"status\": \"in_progress\",\r","-    \"updated_at\": 1792918984.2703657,\r","+    \"updated_at\": 1792919353.0459323,\r","     \"owner\": \"claude-code:f36d48df\",\r","     \"started_by\": \"claude-code:f36d48df\",\r","     \"continuations\": []\