10-25T09:14:44.160Z","advisorModel":"claude-opus-5-5","effort":"medium","perTurnEffort":"medium","userType":"external","entrypoint":"claude-vscode","cwd":"C:\\Users\\Yunus-Emre\\Desktop\\portable_agent_kit\\projects\\voidfarer","sessionId":"f36d48df-8ecb-4c1e-b9ec-e914222b95e3","version":"2.1.310","gitBranch":"main"}
{"parentUuid":"ee5a266e-ad35-4d74-bea5-e6fe547c3813","isSidechain":false,"promptId":"7fcf398a-b890-49b3-a922-527d49e77330","type":"user","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"tool_use_id":"toolu_01UbSdjC2CNvLMYwUCR2q7H4","type":"tool_result","content":"### 14. Geopolitical Factions & Megacorporations\n```bash\n# View all sovereign galactic factions, ideologies, territorial HQs, and standing\npython -m voidfarer.cli factions\n\n# View galactic megacorporations, commercial specialties, and trade perks\npython -m voidfarer.cli corporations\n```\n\npython -m voidfarer.cli crew shore\npython -m voidfarer.cli weapons install railgun\n```\nThe commander ages, earns XP, and trains six skills with active cooldown abilities. Research\nunlocks reactor, scan, combat, outpost, repair, and fuel tech. Outposts produce resources each tick.\nFaction leaders wage wars, capture systems, and face elimination. Escort warships coordinate volleys,\nscreen damage, and adopt battle stances. Multi-jump routing handles black holes. Message trees branch\ninto lasting outcomes. Crew feature roles, morale, wages, and SVG portraits; morale reacts to\nbattles, hull breaches, void storms, hostile arrivals, and campaign beats, unpaid crews below\nmorale 20 risk resignation, and docked stations offer paid shore leave. Bulk orders walk the\nlocal stockpile price, and the status deck, CLI, and crew tab show per-tick cash flow. The\n- **Menu, Settings & Saves (`ESC`)**: volume, auto-pause on intercepts/events, auto-claim, order lot, key list, reset; saves.\npython -m voidfarer.cli depot sell titanium 1","is_error":false}]},"uuid":"ce472168-1bb5-489b-a292-17fff9e2ff6e","timestamp":"2026-10-25T09:14:45.064Z","toolUseResult":{"stdout":"### 14. Geopolitical Factions & Megacorporations\n```bash\n# View all sovereign galactic factions, ideologies, territorial HQs, and standing\npython -m voidfarer.cli factions\n\n# View galactic megacorporations, commercial specialties, and trade perks\npython -m voidfarer.cli corporations\n```\n\npython -m voidfarer.cli crew shore\npython -m voidfarer.cli weapons install railgun\n```\nThe commander ages, earns XP, and trains six skills with active cooldown abilities. Research\nunlocks reactor, scan, combat, outpost, repair, and fuel tech. Outposts produce resources each tick.\nFaction leaders wage wars, capture systems, and face elimination. Escort warships coordinate volleys,\nscreen damage, and adopt battle stances. Multi-jump routing handles black holes. Message trees branch\ninto lasting outcomes. Crew feature roles, morale, wages, and SVG portraits; morale reacts to\nbattles, hull breaches, void storms, hostile arrivals, and campaign beats, unpaid crews below\nmorale 20 risk resignation, and docked stations offer paid shore leave. Bulk orders walk the\nlocal stockpile price, and the status deck, CLI, and crew tab show per-tick cash flow. The\n- **Menu, Settings & Saves (`ESC`)**: volume, auto-pause on intercepts/events, auto-claim, order lot, key list, reset; saves.\npython -m voidfarer.cli depot sell titanium 1","stderr":"","interrupted":false,"isImage":false,"noOutputExpected":false},"serverClassifierContext":{"request":"6895608b-c330-4d99-b67e-f6efc3f867ad","context":{"git_state":{"cwd":"/c/Users/Yunus-Emre/Desktop/portable_agent_kit/projects/voidfarer","root":"/c/Users/Yunus-Emre/Desktop/portable_agent_kit/projects/voidfarer","branch":"master","default_branch":null,"status":{"clean":false,"counts":{"staged":0,"modified":16,"untracked":null,"untracked_normal":5},"porcelain":null,"truncated":false},"visibility":{"origin":{"host":"github.com","remote":"Aegean-E/voidfarer","visibility":"public"},"push_remote":"origin","remotes":[{"name":"origin","host":"github.com","remote":"Aegean-E/voidfarer","visibility":"public"}],"visibility_cache":[{"host":"github.com","remote":"Aegean-E/AIKit","visibility":"public"},{"host":"github.com","remote":"Aegean-E/voidfarer","visibility":"public"}]}},"live_cwd":"/c/Users/Yunus-Emre/Desktop/portable_