{"parentUuid":"66673823-1fc6-49da-846c-900904d0dcea","isSidechain":false,"message":{"model":"claude-opus-5-5","id":"msg_011CgNhbjgZiKdyaQM2JuyQz","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"text","text":"I'll document the war commands, the new war rules, monthly payroll, the strategic map and `celestial.js`, then trim to fit:"}],"container":null,"stop_reason":"tool_use","stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":2,"cache_creation_input_tokens":683,"cache_read_input_tokens":611229,"output_tokens":1335,"output_tokens_details":{"thinking_tokens":513},"server_tool_use":{"web_search_requests":0,"web_fetch_requests":0},"service_tier":"standard","cache_creation":{"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":683,"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0},"inference_geo":"global","iterations":[{"input_tokens":2,"output_tokens":1335,"cache_read_input_tokens":611229,"cache_creation_input_tokens":683,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":683},"type":"message"}],"speed":"standard","fallback_credit":null},"input_transformations":[],"diagnostics":null,"context_management":null},"serverClassifierRequest":"9cc872ab-dd61-43f0-838d-57eb61b6a243","apiBlockIndex":1,"requestId":"req_011CgNhbj66syVUraJGf5qHn","requestRef":"e6951464-c9e2-4358-af3a-3744b5c0d431","requestedModel":"claude-opus-5-5","type":"assistant","uuid":"8a34fff8-9e0c-401c-a27d-14a30171049c","timestamp":"2026-10-25T09:14:52.405Z","advisorModel":"claude-opus-5-5","effort":"medium","perTurnEffort":"medium","userType":"external","entrypoint":"claude-vscode","cwd":"C:\\Users\\Yunus-Emre\\Desktop\\portable_agent_kit\\projects\\voidfarer","sessionId":"f36d48df-8ecb-4c1e-b9ec-e914222b95e3","version":"2.1.310","gitBranch":"main"}
{"parentUuid":"8a34fff8-9e0c-401c-a27d-14a30171049c","isSidechain":false,"message":{"model":"claude-opus-5-5","id":"msg_011CgNhbjgZiKdyaQM2JuyQz","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"tool_use","id":"toolu_013gDQjaMwEcWrG6hsDcFxjV","name":"Bash","input":{"command":"python - <<'EOF'\nfrom pathlib import Path\np = Path(\"README.md\")\ns = p.read_text(encoding=\"utf-8\")\nreps = [\n(\"\"\"# View galactic megacorporations, commercial specialties, and trade perks\npython -m voidfarer.cli corporations\n```\n\"\"\", \"\"\"# View galactic megacorporations, commercial specialties, and trade perks\npython -m voidfarer.cli corporations\n\n# Galactic wars: powers, fronts and captures; pledge credits to one side\npython -m voidfarer.cli war list\npython -m voidfarer.cli war support w_1 vanguard_syndicate 800\n```\n\"\"\"),\n(\"Faction leaders wage wars, capture systems, and face elimination.\",\n \"Wars run along hyperlane fronts: strength, overextension and attrition decide captures, capitals fall last, treaties and truces end them.\"),\n(\"local stockpile price, and the status deck, CLI, and crew tab show per-tick cash flow.\",\n \"local stockpile price; wages accrue as a monthly payroll shown as net cr/month.\"),\n(\"│       ├── app.js            <- radar math, Web Audio synth & REST link\\n\",\n \"│       ├── app.js            <- radar math, Web Audio synth & REST link\\n│       ├── celestial.js      <- procedural planet, station & ship models\\n\"),\n(\"- **Living Galaxy**: Procedural worlds, AI traders, dynamic markets, faction perks, and reputation.\\n\",\n \"- **Living Galaxy**: Procedural worlds, AI traders, dynamic markets, faction perks, and reputation.\\n- **Strategic Map**: faction territories, borders, war fronts, a powers legend; modelled worlds and ships.\\n\"),\n]\nfor a, b in reps:\n    assert s.count(a) == 1, a[:50]\n    s = s.replace(a, b)\np.write_text(s, encoding=\"utf-8\")\nprint(len(s))\nEOF","description":"Document war CLI, war rules, payroll, map and celestial module"},"caller":{"type":"direct"}}],"container":null,"stop_reason":"tool_use","stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":2,"cache_creation_input_tokens":683,"cache_read_input_tokens":611229,"output_tokens":1335,"output_tokens_details":{"thinking_tokens":513},"server_tool_use":{"web_search_requests":0,"web_fetch_requests":0},"service_tier":"standard","cache_creation":{"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":683,"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0},"inference_geo":"global","iterations":[{"input_tokens":2,"output_tokens":1335,"cache_read_input_tokens":611229,"cache_creation_input_tokens":683,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":683},"type":"message"}],"speed":"standard","fallback_credit":null},"input_transformations":[],"diagnostics":null,"context_management":null},"wireToolInputs":{"toolu_013gDQjaMwEcWrG6hsDcFxjV":{"command":"cd /c/Users/Yunus-Emre/Desktop/portable_agent_kit/projects/voidfarer && python - <<'EOF'\nfrom pathlib import Path\np = Path(\"README.md\")\ns = p.read_text(encoding=\"utf-8\")\nreps = [\n(\"\"\"# View galactic megacorporations, commercial specialties, and trade perks\npython -m voidfarer.cli corporations\n```\n\"\"\", \"\"\"# View galactic megacorporations, commercial specialties, and trade perks\npython -m voidfarer.cli corporations\n\n# Galactic wars: powers, fronts and captures; pledge credits to one side\npython -m voidfarer.cli war list\npython -m voidfarer.cli war support w_1 vanguard_syndicate 800\n```\n\"\"\"),\n(\"Faction leaders wage wars, capture systems, and face elimination.\",\n \"Wars run along hyperlane fronts: strength, overextension and attrition decide captures, capitals fall last, treaties and truces end them.\"),\n(\"local stockpile price, and the status deck, CLI, and crew tab show per-tick cash flow.\",\n \"local stockpile price; wages accrue as a monthly payroll shown as net cr/month.\"),\n(\"│       ├── app.js            <- radar math, Web Audio synth