{"type":"api-request-blob","sessionId":"f36d48df-8ecb-4c1e-b9ec-e914222b95e3","hash":"e761d9f46788fdc8cfa588ccfca1b2ecae4a16ab783bb3e83b33ff3556f033ce","message":{"role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"","signature":""},{"type":"text","text":"I'll document the war commands, the new war rules, monthly payroll, the strategic map and `celestial.js`, then trim to fit:"},{"type":"tool_use","id":"toolu_013gDQjaMwEcWrG6hsDcFxjV","name":"Bash","input":{"command":"cd /c/Users/Yunus-Emre/Desktop/portable_agent_kit/projects/voidfarer && python - <<'EOF'\nfrom pathlib import Path\np = Path(\"README.md\")\ns = p.read_text(encoding=\"utf-8\")\nreps = [\n(\"\"\"# View galactic megacorporations, commercial specialties, and trade perks\npython -m voidfarer.cli corporations\n```\n\"\"\", \"\"\"# View galactic megacorporations, commercial specialties, and trade perks\npython -m voidfarer.cli corporations\n\n# Galactic wars: powers, fronts and captures; pledge credits to one side\npython -m voidfarer.cli war list\npython -m voidfarer.cli war support w_1 vanguard_syndicate 800\n```\n\"\"\"),\n(\"Faction leaders wage wars, capture systems, and face elimination.\",\n \"Wars run along hyperlane fronts: strength, overextension and attrition decide captures, capitals fall last, treaties and truces end them.\"),\n(\"local stockpile price, and the status deck, CLI, and crew tab show per-tick cash flow.\",\n \"local stockpile price; wages accrue as a monthly payroll shown as net cr/month.\"),\n(\"│       ├── app.js            <- radar math, Web Audio synth & REST link\\n\",\n \"│       ├── app.js            <- radar math, Web Audio synth & REST link\\n│       ├── celestial.js      <- procedural planet, station & ship models\\n\"),\n(\"- **Living Galaxy**: Procedural worlds, AI traders, dynamic markets, faction perks, and reputation.\\n\",\n \"- **Living Galaxy**: Procedural worlds, AI traders, dynamic markets, faction perks, and reputation.\\n- **Strategic Map**: faction territories, borders, war fronts, a powers legend; modelled worlds and ships.\\n\"),\n]\nfor a, b in reps:\n    assert s.count(a) == 1, a[:50]\n    s = s.replace(a, b)\np.write_text(s, encoding=\"utf-8\")\nprint(len(s))\nEOF","description":"Document war CLI, war rules, payroll, map and celestial module"},"caller":{"type":"direct"}}]}}
