ude-vscode","cwd":"C:\\Users\\Yunus-Emre\\Desktop\\portable_agent_kit\\projects\\voidfarer","sessionId":"f36d48df-8ecb-4c1e-b9ec-e914222b95e3","version":"2.1.310","gitBranch":"main"}
{"parentUuid":"f25d8953-b0df-4b52-8d91-2aa9c2fee8ab","isSidechain":false,"promptId":"7fcf398a-b890-49b3-a922-527d49e77330","type":"user","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"tool_use_id":"toolu_014tL4CgBzP3ewgjXw9P9EvL","type":"tool_result","content":"7: VoidFarer is a zero-dependency, local-first space flight, fleet and exploration simulation. Explore procedural systems, route reactor power, board derelicts, scoop fuel, command drones, fit upgrades, fight adaptive AI and trade, from an ANSI REPL or a Windows HTML5 Canvas cockpit.\n121: Prints the sector hyperlane network, visited flags, security ratings, and every body in the local system. Each system hosts 5-6 planets, moons, ice/lava worlds, ringed giants, and research outposts, with a guaranteed dockable station.\n148: Scans need 5 MW of sensor power; a failed zero-power attempt no longer consumes the body. Full-system surveys pay a bonus and advance `systems_surveyed`; titanium salvage advances mining contracts; each scoopable body has a finite 3-8 tap reserve that recharges one tap every 6 ticks.\n263: The five-act campaign tracks persistent story flags: later choices can require earlier decisions (Act V's title needs the Act IV Oath; selling the echoes needs the Act I Syndicate leak), locked choices show their reasons, and the finale resolves First VoidFarer, Sentinel, or Shadow Broker. Legacy saves migrate on load.\n279: Black-hole anchors mesh into a seeded void-lane graph. Diving needs a horizon orbit, route fuel, and 25% shields; storms drain stability, shields and hull. Each storm adds resonance (+1, doubled below 30% stability) worth 120 cr and 15 XP on arrival; `void emerge` banks half, collapse loses all. `gateways_open` calms storms 25%, and the Void Compass and Crown of Echoes raise starting stability.","is_error":false}]},"uuid":"e651a851-3478-407c-a72a-6656164aa52d","timestamp":"2026-10-25T09:15:05.292Z","toolUseResult":{"stdout":"7: VoidFarer is a zero-dependency, local-first space flight, fleet and exploration simulation. Explore procedural systems, route reactor power, board derelicts, scoop fuel, command drones, fit upgrades, fight adaptive AI and trade, from an ANSI REPL or a Windows HTML5 Canvas cockpit.\n121: Prints the sector hyperlane network, visited flags, security ratings, and every body in the local system. Each system hosts 5-6 planets, moons, ice/lava worlds, ringed giants, and research outposts, with a guaranteed dockable station.\n148: Scans need 5 MW of sensor power; a failed zero-power attempt no longer consumes the body. Full-system surveys pay a bonus and advance `systems_surveyed`; titanium salvage advances mining contracts; each scoopable body has a finite 3-8 tap reserve that recharges one tap every 6 ticks.\n263: The five-act campaign tracks persistent story flags: later choices can require earlier decisions (Act V's title needs the Act IV Oath; selling the echoes needs the Act I Syndicate leak), locked choices show their reasons, and the finale resolves First VoidFarer, Sentinel, or Shadow Broker. Legacy saves migrate on load.\n279: Black-hole anchors mesh into a seeded void-lane graph. Diving needs a horizon orbit, route fuel, and 25% shields; storms drain stability, shields and hull. Each storm adds resonance (+1, doubled below 30% stability) worth 120 cr and 15 XP on arrival; `void emerge` banks half, collapse loses all. `gateways_open` calms storms 25%, and the Void Compass and Crown of Echoes raise starting stability.","stderr":"","interrupted":false,"isImage":false,"noOutputExpected":false},"serverClassifierContext":{"request":"3d335384-fbd2-4776-b6b9-402087479f76","context":{"git_state":{"cwd":"/c/Users/Yunus-Emre/Desktop/portable_agent_kit/projects/voidfarer","root":"/c/Users/Yunus-Emre/Desktop/portable_agent_kit/projects/voidfarer","branch":"master","default_branch":null,"status":{"clean":false,"counts":{"staged":0,"modified":16,"untracked":null,"untracked_normal":5},"porcelain":null,"truncated":false},"visibility":{"origin":{"host":"github.com","remote":"Aegean-E/voidfarer","visibility":"public"},"push_remote":"origin","remotes":[{"name":"origin","host":"github.com","remote":"Aegean-E/voidfarer","visibility":"public"}],"visibility_cache":[{"host":"github.com","remote":"Aegean-E/AIKit","visibility":"public"},{"host":"github.com","remote":"Aegean-E/voidfarer","visibility":"public"}]}},"live_cwd":"/c/Users/Yunus-Emre/Desktop/portable_agent_kit/projects/voidfarer","platform":"windows"}},"sandboxed":false,"sourceToolAssistantUUID":"f25d8953-b0df-4b52-8d91-2aa9c2fee8ab","permissionDecision":{"decision":"accept","source":"config","reasonType":"classifier"},"userType":"external","entrypoint":"claude-vscode","cwd":"C:\\Users\\Yunus-Emre\\Desktop\\portable_agent_kit\\projects\\voidfarer","sessionId":"f36d48df-8ecb-4c1e-b9ec-e914222b95e3","version":"2.1.310","gitBranch":"main"}
