{"parentUuid":"31da595c-5d83-4067-8904-e00d8fefc9ea","isSidechain":false,"promptId":"7fcf398a-b890-49b3-a922-527d49e77330","type":"user","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"tool_use_id":"toolu_01WKyfDsnvgNZ5wPPSyciXa8","type":"tool_result","content":"696:### ADR-057: Grand-Strategy Layer: Fronts, Territory, Celestial Models and a Monthly Treasury\n4/4 gates passed for 'voidfarer'\n[OK] Checkpoint recorded: Task 'grand-strategy-v1', Phase 4 (phase 4) - [5/5] Docs: README war CLI, war rules, monthly payroll, strategic map, celestial.js, 34 suites (22,341 chars), ADR-057 with outpost rebalance follow-up; 565 tests; 4/4 gates; uncommitted pending user commit request; checklists: passed\r\n M .aikit/codebase_map.md\n M .aikit/decisions.md\n M .aikit/task_ledger.json\n M README.md\n M tests/test_cli.py\n M tests/test_cockpit_layout.py\n M tests/test_sim_mechanics.py\n M voidfarer/cli.py\n M voidfarer/crew.py\n M voidfarer/engine.py\n M voidfarer/faction_state.py\n M voidfarer/models.py\n M voidfarer/server.py\n M voidfarer/static/app.js\n M voidfarer/static/index.html\n M voidfarer/static/style.css\n?? tests/test_galactic_politics.py\n?? tests/test_monthly_economy.py\n?? tests/test_snapshot_catalogs.py\n?? tests/test_trade_ledger.py\n?? voidfarer/static/celestial.js","is_error":false}]},"uuid":"c05409b7-c036-4107-a7f2-a84cbfc2e51f","timestamp":"2026-10-25T09:16:13.801Z","toolUseResult":{"stdout":"696:### ADR-057: Grand-Strategy Layer: Fronts, Territory, Celestial Models and a Monthly Treasury\n4/4 gates passed for 'voidfarer'\n[OK] Checkpoint recorded: Task 'grand-strategy-v1', Phase 4 (phase 4) - [5/5] Docs: README war CLI, war rules, monthly payroll, strategic map, celestial.js, 34 suites (22,341 chars), ADR-057 with outpost rebalance follow-up; 565 tests; 4/4 gates; uncommitted pending user commit request; checklists: passed\r\n M .aikit/codebase_map.md\n M .aikit/decisions.md\n M .aikit/task_ledger.json\n M README.md\n M tests/test_cli.py\n M tests/test_cockpit_layout.py\n M tests/test_sim_mechanics.py\n M voidfarer/cli.py\n M voidfarer/crew.py\n M voidfarer/engine.py\n M voidfarer/faction_state.py\n M voidfarer/models.py\n M voidfarer/server.py\n M voidfarer/static/app.js\n M voidfarer/static/index.html\n M voidfarer/static/style.css\n?? tests/test_galactic_politics.py\n?? tests/test_monthly_economy.py\n?? tests/test_snapshot_catalogs.py\n?? tests/test_trade_ledger.py\n?? voidfarer/static/celestial.js","stderr":"","interrupted":false,"isImage":false,"noOutputExpected":false,"bashEditDiff":{"files":[{"filePath":"C:\\Users\\Yunus-Emre\\Desktop\\portable_agent_kit\\projects\\voidfarer\\.aikit\\decisions.md","hunks":[{"oldStart":692,"oldLines":3,"newStart":692,"newLines":15,"lines":["   4. The strip sits beside a full-height terminal at every width, panels are uncapped, and sliders and presets commit on release when the total is at most 100% (APPLY ROUTE remains as a retry). Below 1600px the strip compacts: short titles, VENT on the heat row, single-column skills, stacked market trade buttons and fixed market columns.\r","   5. The streak card shows the count with the multiplier in its subline; sector chips sit top-left of the radar; the PLAYER XP label is 12px.\r"," - **Consequences**: Lite polls are 86 KB instead of 133 KB and full snapshots build in ~1.1 ms instead of ~2.1 ms; at 10x the HUD refreshes ~3.5 times a second at 60 FPS with no long tasks. The terminal grows from 153 to 480px at 1280x720 and from 201 to 528px at 1366x768, and no strip control is clipped at 720p, laptop, desktop or 4K. Real-Edge runs pass 5/5 power-routing checks at 1080p and 720p and 8/8 polling checks. The suite grows to 538 tests (32 suites).\r","+\r","+### ADR-057: Grand-Strategy Layer: Fronts, Territory, Celestial Models and a Monthly Treasury\r","+- **Date**: 2026-10-25\r","+- **Status**: Accepted\r","+- **Context**: The user asked for a Stellaris-like grand strategy feel with simulation mechanics. Wars were coin flips (score +/- uniform(-3, 5)) that, once past 12, captured a system every tick because the score never reset; captures ignored geography; wars never ended; population dominated faction strength. Over 3,000 ticks Sol Coalition took all 15 systems on every seed. The galaxy map showed no ownership, worlds were flat dots, outposts had no UI, and crew wages were charged in full every 0.25-day tick, bankrupting a new commander (2,000 cr, 65 cr wage bill) in 40 ticks, 20 seconds at 1x.\r","+- **Decision**:\r","+  1. War resolution: score = score x (1 - 0.05 attrition) + momentum + uniform(+/-2.5). Momentum = 3 x (effort difference / sum) with containment (-1.2 against a 40%+ hegemon) and last stand (0.6 per missing core system). War effort = (100 x systems + 60 x log10(1 + population in millions)) / (1 + 0.35 x systems beyond 3). Reaching 12 captures one hyperlane front system (`frontier_systems`) and spends 12; capitals need 24 and fall last; no shared border stalls the offensive. Treaties end wars after 240 ticks or 3 captures; a 600-tick truce follows; a defending faction cannot be attacked a second time; declarations roll at 2.5% per tick.\r","+  2. `WarState` gains `captured_systems`, `ended_tick` and `support` (backward-compatible defaults). `support_war` lets the player pledge credits (minimum 100; shift up to 6 at 400 cr per point; standing up with the backed side, down with its enemy) via REST `/api/war/support`, CLI `war list|support` and cockpit BACK buttons. `galactic_politics` exposes owners, borders, fronts and powers in the snapshot.\r","+  3. The galaxy map renders cached, quarter-resolution Voronoi faction territory with blurred borders, border-crossing lanes, pulsing red front lanes, owner rings and a powers legend, fitted to the visible map area via a shared `mapRect`/`mapCenter`.\r","+  4. New `static/celestial.js` (`CelestialRenderer`) paints seeded, cached models for all 21 body types, star coronas, asteroid belt bands, moons, a star-facing terminator and the flagship silhouette; body display size is logarithmic in radius and shared with hit tests.\r","+  5. Crew wages are a monthly rate accrued on the calendar (`wages_due`, 30-day months); a MONTH END report logs payroll and treasury; `cash_flow` reports per-month keys (the existing cash-flow test now asserts the same values under `*_per_month`). The Empire tab founds outposts for the orbited world, and the credits card shows net cr/month.\r","+- **Consequences**: Over 3,000 ticks on six seeds wars capture 13-26 systems with no eliminations and no faction above 4 of 15 systems; the map reads as a living political map; worlds and stations are recognisable at a glance; a new commander pays 65 cr/month. Known follow-up: outposts still yield per tick (a mining outpost earns ~1,200 cr/month against an 1,800 cr cost) and want a monthly rebalance. Territory rebuild costs 4.6 ms at 1080p and 7.9 ms at 4K; frames stay at 0.1-0.3 ms. The suite grows to 565 tests (34 suites).\r"]}]},{"filePath":"C:\\Users\\Yunus-Emre\\Desktop\\portable_agent_kit\\projects\\voidfarer\\.aikit\\task_ledger.json","hunks":[{"oldStart":5,"oldLines":22,"newStart":5,"newLines":12,"lines":["     \"last_phase\": \"phase 4\",\r","     \"active_phase\": 4,\r","     \"status\": \"in_progress\",\r","-    \"updated_at\": 1792919674.6021585,\r","+    \"updated_at\": 1792919773.3660283,\r","     \"owner\": \"claude-code:f36d48df\",\r","     \"started_by\": \"claude-code:f36d48df\",\r","     \"continuations\": []\r","   },\r","   \"checkpoints\": [\r","-    {\r","-      \"task_id\": \"transit-hazards-course-preview-v1\",\r","-      \"phase\": \"completed\",\r","-      \"phase_num\": 5,\r","-      \"description\": \"Task 'transit-hazards-course-preview-v1' completed successfully.\",\r","-      \"status\": \"completed\",\r","-      \"timestamp\": 1792877477.070814,\r","-      \"timestamp_str\": \"2026-10-25 00:31:17\",\r","-      \"agent\": \"antigravity\"\r","-    },\r","     {\r","       \"task_id\": \"left-panel-qol-ledger-v1\",\r","       \"phase\": \"phase 2\",\r"]},{"oldStart":252,"oldLines":6,"newStart":242,"newLines":17,"lines":["       \"timestamp\": 1792919674.6021585,\r","       \"timestamp_str\": \"2026-10-25 12:14:34\",\r","       \"agent\": \"claude-code:f36d48df\"\r","+    },\r","+    {\r","+      \"task_id\": \"grand-strategy-v1\",\r","+      \"phase\": \"phase 4\",\r","+      \"phase_num\": 4,\r","+      \"description\": \"[5/5] Docs: README war CLI, war rules, monthly payroll, strategic map, celestial.js, 34 suites (22,341 chars), ADR-057 with outpost rebalance follow-up; 565 tests; 4/4 gates; uncommitted pending user commit request; checklists: passed\",\r","+      \"files_affected\": [],\r","+      \"status\": \"in_progress\",\r","+      \"timestamp\": 1792919773.3660283,\r","+      \"timestamp_str\": \"2026-10-25 12:16:13\",\r","+      \"agent\": \"claude-code:f36d48df\"\r","     }\r","   ]\r"," }"]}]}],"moreFiles":0,"changedFiles":["C:\\Users\\Yunus-Emre\\Desktop\\portable_agent_kit\\projects\\voidfarer\\.aikit\\decisions.md","C:\\Users\\Yunus-Emre\\Desktop\\portable_agent_kit\\projects\\voidfarer\\.aikit\\task_ledger.json"]}},"serverClassifierContext":{"request":"2e711a66-c1e7-47a5-aa12-b850dc55eda7","context":{"git_state":{"cwd":"/c/Users/Yunus-Emre/Desktop/portable_agent_kit/projects/voidfarer","root":"/c/Users/Yunus-Emre/Desktop/portable_agent_kit/projects/voidfarer","branch":"master","default_branch":null,"status":{"clean":false,"counts":{"staged":0,"modified":16,"untracked":null,"untracked_normal":5},"porcelain":null,"truncated":false},"visibility":{"origin":{"host":"github.com","remote":"Aegean-E/voidfarer","visibility":"public"},"push_remote":"origin","remotes":[{"name":"origin","host":"github.com","remote":"Aegean-E/voidfarer","visibility":"public"}],"visibility_cache":[{"host":"github.com","remote":"Aegean-E/AIKit","visibility":"public"},{"host":"github.com","remote":"Aegean-E/voidfarer","visibility":"public"}]}},"live_cwd":"/c/Users/Yunus-Emre/Desktop/portable_agent_kit/projects/voidfarer","platform":"windows"}},"sandboxed":false,"sourceToolAssistantUUID":"31da595c-5d83-4067-8904-e00d8fefc9ea","permissionDecision":{"decision":"accept","source":"config","reasonType":"classifier"},"userType":"external","entrypoint":"claude-vscode","cwd":"C:\\Users\\Yunus-Emre\\Desktop\\portable_agent_kit\\projects\\voidfarer","sessionId":"f36d48df-8ecb-4c1e-b9ec-e914222b95e3","version":"2.1.310","gitBranch":"main"}
